# Content-addressed data must never be rewritten by Git.
#
# The V3-1A protocol fixtures are pinned by sha256 in
# soma/worker_adapters/fixtures/manifest.json. This repository is used with
# core.autocrlf=true, so without this rule a fresh checkout would rewrite every
# fixture's line endings and invalidate every pinned hash.
#
# "-text" disables end-of-line conversion entirely for these paths. It is
# deliberately scoped to the fixture directory so no existing file changes
# behaviour.
soma/worker_adapters/fixtures/** -text
